title: February 2027

@sikorski_marriage_revolt_2027
# prose-audit: Grade A — Trzaskowski outside the Sejm, the double police cordon and the three constitutional variants were always right; the three responses now differ in who owns the defence — a shared march with a division list on the leaflet, a smaller front that belongs to us, or filings that will still be working in eighteen months.
